##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
##Scene Two spheres of MaterialX materials: a network written inline, and a material read from a document
version 3.03
Format 48 32 1
PixelSamples 4 4
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.01 100
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "distantlight" 1 "intensity" [1.5] "from" [0 0 0] "to" [1 -2 1]
AttributeBegin
Translate -0.8 0 0
Pattern "ND_constant_color3" "tint" "color value" [0.9 0.6 0.2]
Bxdf "ND_open_pbr_surface_surfaceshader" "gold" "reference color base_color" ["tint:out"] "float base_metalness" [1] "float specular_roughness" [0.3]
Sphere 0.6 -0.6 0.6 360
AttributeEnd
AttributeBegin
Translate 0.8 0 0
Bxdf "materialx" "painted" "string file" ["data/materials-painted.mtlx"] "string material" ["painted"] "float specular_roughness" [0.6]
Sphere 0.6 -0.6 0.6 360
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
